menu "Yaykit cloud"

config YK_CLOUD_ORIGIN
    string "Device API origin"
    default "https://device.yaykit.io"
    help
        Origin of the device API (services/device). Yaykit has one environment since 2026-10-17. Until
        image signing ships (docs/architecture/device-platform.md 6.2), cloud firmware goes only to
        internal test builds, not public releases.

endmenu
